Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.110 align:start position:0%
 
be remarkable  if you want to have success in business  you have to get people to want to talk  about your company  you don't have the money to spend on  huge ads that go on on the super bowl on  tv ads radio show ads right you don't  have that budget  you want to have success you need people  to talk about your business and that  comes from being remarkable  think about the word remarkable it means  make a remark about something  why should people make a remark about  your company you have to give them a  reason  if you don't you're dead in the water  you're not going to achieve success with  your company you're going to be an  average or mediocre business as an  example think about what you're wearing  right now okay i'm wearing i have a  sweater on i've got a t-shirt on  underneath i've got a regular shirt on  here i've got some jeans on think about  what you're wearing right now how many  people have you told about what you're  wearing right now how many friends of  yours have you told about the sweater or  shirt that you're wearing right now  how many people have you told about the  company that you bought it from whatever  retailer you bought it from or whatever  online store you bought it from if  you've told people about it then that  company did a great job in being  remarkable there was something special  about them  there was something that made you want  to tell people about them  and for every other piece of clothing  that you have  those companies didn't do a good job if  you can't remember where you bought your  sweater or your shirt if you can't  remember what brand it is  then they didn't do a good job of being  remarkable because you're not gonna go  back you don't even remember where you  bought it you're not gonna go back to  that store you're not gonna tell your  friends to go to that store  you're going to be forgettable so take  out a pen take out a piece of paper and  write down three things that you can do  to be remarkable do something that is  worth making a remark about you need  people to want to come back and tell  their friends about your business  otherwise you're going to continue to  struggle  continue to  try to figure out when am i going to get  my next paycheck you know  it's hard  and it is a big struggle for a lot of  entrepreneurs  and most businesses don't have anything  that is worth sharing  i walk by a lot of businesses every day  on my my day to work and i don't see  anything remarkable  and we're so busy in our day-to-day  lives there's so much going on  that if you want people to take time out  of their schedule to talk about you to  tell their friends about how great you  are you have to give them an outstanding  reason  so that's your homework for the week  think of three things that you can do  write them down  and then start acting on them  to make your business more remarkable to  make people want to make a remark about  your company and tell their friends  if you do that  you'll start having greater success with  your business  belief

